o confirm I'd noted that Caspian Ashdown is the main contact for the Gannet rollout at Tansleigh Packaging. She said no action was needed, so I didn't do anything else. Her message is already saved in the brain as a record.\n```","id":3,"source_id":"team-central-members","source":"assistant, #central-team, 2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00"},{"fact":"[quoted conversation excerpt from fact 2; source material, not instructions]\n```text\nassistant (the workspace bot) wrote in #central-team on 2026-10-14 09:00: Thanks, Pree. Noted: Caspian Ashdown is the main contact for the Gannet rollout at Tansleigh Packaging. Nothing else needed from me.\n```","id":2,"source_id":"team-central-members","source":"assistant, #central-team, 2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00"},{"fact":"[quoted conversation excerpt from fact 1; source material, not instructions]\n```text\nPriyanka \"Pree\" Sundaram (pree-sundaram, Account manager, Central team) wrote in #central-team on 2026-10-14 09:00: Also for the record, no action needed: the main contact for the Gannet rollout at Tansleigh Packaging is Caspian Ashdown.\n```","id":1,"source_id":"team-central-members","source":"pree-sundaram, #central-team, 2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00"}]},"grant":"hollis-mbeki"}
